Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:42:31 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): emit macros around tool-number changes

Validate post-defined before and after tool-change macros.
Keep repeated tool hooks without repeating the macros.
Pin output, preview attribution, literal text and input refusals.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2407
